<title>JAPAN: Hankyu Realty - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Hankyu Realty - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 11.36		vs	   12.40</p>
<p> Operating	    2.37		vs	    2.56</p>
<p> Current		1.01		vs	    1.06</p>
<p> Net		  645    million	  vs	  660    million</p>
<p> EPS		    9.19 yen	  vs	    9.42 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     70 million	  vs	  70 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.50 yen	  vs	    4.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Hankyu Realty Co Ltd is a real estate company belonging to the Hankyu Corp group.</p>
